# GMS raises the shield on a chance when struck, for ninety seconds and ten
# blows, and cannot raise it again for thirty from the moment it went up. All
# of that is here now that Buff.shield exists: the shell cancels whole hits
# and falls the moment its count runs out, clock or no clock.
#
# The chance it goes up at all is dropped -- certain at master level, and a
# buff either stands or does not. The attack it grants is permanent, as GMS
# says it is: it survives the shell it came up with.
#
# GMS's damage reduction is paid "only for attacks that inflict damage at a
# certain ratio of the max HP". Nothing here deals damage that way, so a boss
# stands in for one -- the same reading Holy Magic Shell takes.
#
# GMS's own ten levels, exact at every one of them.
name: "Divine Shield"
skill_order: 8
description:
  "When struck, generates a shield that blocks a number of blows and "
  "permanently increases your Attack Power."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_WHITE_KNIGHT
max_level: 10
base { attack: 2 }
per_level { attack: 2 }
buff {
  duration_seconds: 90.0
  shield {
    hits: 1.0
    hits_per_level: 1.0
    boss_damage_taken_pct: 0.07
  }
}
cooldown_seconds: 30.0
